nt in the near  future  and it would be cool if that happens  during this confrontation between deku  and class  1a i mean just imagine deku choosing to  go with stain  over his class 1a comrades that would be  so crazy  and yet it would kind of make sense at  this point in the story don't forget to  let me know what you guys thought about  this confrontation between deco and  class 1a  and what do you think is going to happen  next let me know down below  if you enjoyed this pocono hero video  and you want to see more  leave a like to let me know it only  takes a second but it helps a lot  and if you're new to anime pro or maybe  you watch our videos but you haven't  taken the time to subscribe yet  do me a favor make this the video that  you subscribe and hit  that notification bell to turn on all  notifications  you really have to go through the  trouble of subscribing hitting that bell  and then selecting the option that says  all if you don't do that you're still  going to miss a ton of our videos even  if you are subscribed it's just how  youtube works  you can also hit me up on twitter and  instagram at  animeopror thanks again to nab new for  sponsoring this video  check them out link in the description  as always thank you guys so much for  watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you

